OL,3,AFormer MI6 spy takes Trump to Scottish
OL,4,Acourt for #800,000 legal payout
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company founded by a former spy is
OL,7,Fpursuing Donald Trump at a small
OL,8,FScottish court for more than #800,000
OL,9,Fin unpaid legal costs.
OL,11,FThe US president was named in a hearing
OL,12,Fat Ayr Sheriff Court as Orbis Business
OL,13,FIntelligence seeks funds from the Trump
OL,14,FTurnberry golf resort.
OL,16,FThe case concerns legal costs owed by
OL,17,FTrump from a 2024 English data
OL,18,Fprotection case against Orbis's
OL,19,Fdirector Christopher Steele - a former
OL,20,FMI6 agent.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
