OL,5,
OL,6,FBut SLC Turnberry Limited - which owns
OL,7,Fthe course - is disputing Trump's role
OL,8,Fas the "ultimate owner", arguing that
OL,9,Fhis stake in the course is held by a
OL,10,Ftrust.
